contract_change:
  api: "URL credential redaction in refusals and recoveries; stored author, assignee and claim_principal"
  before: "A public URL with an @ in its path lost its host and path and withheld the retry; a credential-bearing PM_AUTHOR, --author or --assignee was stored and echoed verbatim in claim refusals"
  after: "Only userinfo inside the authority is redacted, so scoped-package and blob URLs stay intact with an executable retry; URL userinfo in an asserted or configured identity is replaced with [redacted] before storage, and refusals and claim envelopes redact a stored one"
  migrate: No action for ordinary identities; rewrite a holder stored by an older version with pm update <id> --assignee <name>
